---
import Section from "@components/ui/Section.astro";
import Eyebrow from "@components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
---

<Section
  id="studio-background"
  labelledBy="studio-background-title"
  background="default"
>
  <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-24">
    <div>
      <Eyebrow text="Built from experience" />

      <h2
        id="studio-background-title"
        class="max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-medium
               leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.04em] text-text
               sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        A studio shaped by
        <span class="text-text-muted"> real projects and technical work. </span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-white-soft">
        Triangulated Studio grows out of hands-on experience delivering business
        websites, improving search performance, managing deployments, and
        building full-stack software.
      </p>

      <p class="leading-7 text-text-muted">
        The portfolio includes professional work completed through employment as
        well as independent engineering projects. Each project is presented with
        clear attribution so the role, organization, and circumstances behind
        the work remain transparent.
      </p>

      <p class="leading-7 text-text-muted">
        That combination of client-facing work and software engineering makes it
        possible to approach a simple marketing website and a custom application
        with the same emphasis on clarity, performance, and maintainability.
      </p>

      <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center pt-4">
        <span
          class="h-px flex-1 bg-linear-to-r
                 from-cyan/60 to-transparent"
        ></span>

        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-cyan"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
